flowchart TD
    V[React View / Component] --> A[frontend/src/services/api.js]
    A --> MI[Incoming middleware]
    MI --> C[FastAPI Controller route boundary]
    C --> P[Pydantic validates before route body]
    P --> S[Service: workflow and transaction sequencing]
    S --> R[Repository: ORM operations]
    R --> M[SQLAlchemy Model]
    M --> D[Session / Engine]
    D --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    S --> ZS[ZendeskService]
    ZS --> Z[Zendesk REST API]
    S -. returning response .-> MO[Outgoing middleware]
    MO -.-> A
    Core[Core: Settings / Security / Logging] -.-> C
    Core -.-> S
    Core -.-> D
